r\u003e\u003c/i\u003eThe player will not be punished until he gathers enough non-appealed infractions as for to fill 2 pages. \u0026nbsp;Please fill a report again if that happens.\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRegards,\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI do not have 2 pages.\u003c/i\u003e Both of my excessive Infractions bans were not true.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHere's the URL just in \u0026nbsp;case you don't believe me.\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/a0781e4e7\"\u003ehttps://avicus.net/forums/a0781e4e7\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","body_tagged":"PocketsDude.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI was banned from Avicus for excessive Infractions. I believe that is unfair Here's Why:\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBTW I am not wasting my time. I have been told by an admin that i cannot of been banned. At least not for excessive Infractions.\u003cbr\u003eHere is the exact post he gave me when reporting another player\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"row-fluid\" style=\"width: 847.96875px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"span1\" style=\"float: left; min-height: 1px; margin-left: 0px; width: 50.71875px; box-sizing: border-box; padding-top: 3px; margin-right: 5px;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/javipepe\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none;\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\"round-mini\" src=\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/c2bbfc51d29da9744f4c9d7d0b446c3c?s=45\u0026amp;default=mm\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: auto; height: auto; vertical-align: middle; border: 0px; border-top-left-radius: 3px; border-top-right-radius: 3px; border-bottom-right-radius: 3px; border-bottom-left-radius: 3px; margin: 0px 1px;\" title=\"Image: https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/c2bbfc51d29da9744f4c9d7d0b446c3c?s=45\u0026amp;default=mm\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"