led infractions. Our \"ban guide\" regarding \"Excessive Infractions\" is like following:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\"\u003cb\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eExcessive infractions (2 pages)\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e-\u0026nbsp;\u003ci\u003eTemporary ban | 20 - 25 days\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003eExcessive infractions (2 or more after first \"excessive infractions\" punishment)\u003c/b\u003e\u0026nbsp;-\u0026nbsp;\u003ci\u003ePermanent ban \"\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003eThe player will not be punished until he gathers enough non-appealed infractions as for to fill 2 pages. \u0026nbsp;Please fill a report again if that happens.\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRegards,\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI do not have 2 pages.\u003c/i\u003e Both of my excessive Infractions bans were not true.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHere's the URL just in \u0026nbsp;case you don't believe me.\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/a0781e4e7\"\u003ehttps://avicus.net/forums/a0781e4e7\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","created_at":1435362920,"title":"Why am I wasting my time with another one?","replies":[{"id":202142,"author":"chaibrit1","body":"\u003cspan style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"\u003eHello,\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhat qualifies as excessive infractions may also be known as 15-20 infractions. This is when the player may be temp-banned. After your first temp ban for 15 infractions you received a few more, thus making you eligible for a ban. Plus, naming your appeal \"Why am I wasting my time with another one?\" doesn't help your case. This appeal is\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003edenied\u003c/b\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRegards,\u003cbr\u003eGalaxyBrit\u003cbr\u003eAvicus Network Senior Moderator\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cspan style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"\u003eHello,\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhat qualifies as excessive infractions may also be known as 15-20 infractions. This is when the player may be temp-banned. After your first temp ban for 15 infractions you received a few more, thus making you eligible for a ban. Plus, naming your appeal \"Why am I wasting my time with another one?\" doesn't help your case. This appeal is\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003edenied\u003c/b\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRegards,\u003cbr\u003eGalaxyBrit\u003cbr\u003eAvicus Network Senior Moderator\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e","created_at":1435363601}]}